return {
	["Avast Ye!"] = "Stoj ty tam!",
	["Up to snuff"] = "Nieumytabaka",
	["You unlocked this route."] = "Odblokowales te trase.",
	["Oh, ye must be mistaken - I don't deal with half-done sailing."] = "Och, musisz sie mylic. Nie zajmuje sie takimi sprawami jak zegluga.",
	["Ain't no foolin' these old bones! I ain't dealin' with no privateers!"] = "Moje kosci sa stare, ale sie nie nabiore! Nie zadaje sie z korsarzami!",
	["Har har! Ye think I do business with any scrappy deckhand that washes up here?"] = "Arr! Myslisz, ze robie interesy z pierwszym lepszym szczurem pokladowym, co sie tu zjawi?",
	["Aye, what be this? A landlubber seekin' favor from Morgram? Har har! If ye want my help, I got me own desires - 10 sapphires, rare and shimmerin' like the sea at dawn. Bring 'em to me, and I'll see to it ye get safe passage to the Port Louse."] = "A, coz to? Szczur ladowy szukajacy przyslugi u Morgrama? Jesli chcesz mojej pomocy, mam swoje zachcianki. 10 szafirow, rzadkich i lsniacych jak morze o swicie. Przynies mi je, a zapewnie ci bezpieczna przeprawe do Wyspy Piratow.",
	["Well, I'll be damned! Ye actually got 'em! Look at these beauties - shinin' like stolen moonlight! Ye done good, matey. As promised, I'll see ye safe between this Phantom Port 'ere and Pirate Island."] = "A niech mnie! Naprawde je masz! Spojrz na te pieknosci. Lsnia jak swiatlo ksiezyca, skradzione o brzasku! Dobra robota, kamracie. Jak obiecalem, zapewnie ci bezpieczny transport miedzy Tym portem a Wyspa Piratow. Ale zapamietaj moje slowa: Rudobrody nie jest taki latwy do udobruchania jak ja. Ma slabosc do krwi i bestii.",
	["Har har har! This be a jest, aye? Ye tell me ye got 10 sapphires, but I see nothin' but air in yer hands. Either cough up the goods, or get lost!"] = "Har har har! To jakis zart, co? Mowisz, ze masz 10 szafirow, a ja widze tylko powietrze w twoich dloniach. Albo je dajesz, albo splywaj!",
	["By the briny deep, ye actually did it! The ugly thing's even worse lookin' up close. Fine work, matey! I be willin' to ferry ye to Port Louse, should ye need it. But listen now, there be other Pirate Lords with needs as dire as mine. Ye scratch their backs, and they might be helpin' ye too. If yer still thirsty fer adventure, seek out other pirate lords."] = "Na przeklete glebiny! To paskudztwo wyglada jeszcze gorzej z bliska. Dobra robota, kamracie! Moge cie przewiezc do kryjowki w Hurghadzie, jesli zajdzie taka potrzeba. Ale posluchaj, sa inni Lordowie Piratow z rownie pilnymi potrzebami jak moje. Jesli sie im przysluzysz, moga ci pomoc. Jesli nadal lakniesz przygod, poszukaj Zylety.",
	["Arrr, what kinda fool's game be this? Ye tryin' to swindle ol' Redbeard? Ye best come back when ye actually got that Hydra's head, ye sorry excuse for a deckhand!"] = "Arrr, co to za glupia gra? Probujesz oszukac starego Rudobrodego? Lepiej wracaj, gdy naprawde bedziesz miec glowe Hydry, ty zalosny szczurze zezowy!",
	["What's this? A runt wanderin' onto me ship lookin' fer favors? I don't grant 'em lightly. I got me eyes on somethin' rare - bring me the head of a black panther, and I'll take ye to Pirate Island meself. But don't come back empty-handed, or I'll have ye swabbin' me deck for a month!"] = "Co my tu mamy? Szczeniak walesajacy sie po moim statku w poszukiwaniu przyslug? Nie rozdaje ich na prawo i lewo. Mam oko na cos rzadkiego - przynies mi leb czarnej pantery, a sam zabiore cie na Klif Wyrmow. Ale nie wracaj z pustymi rekami, bo kaze ci szorowac poklad przez miesiac!",
	["Har har! Now THAT'S a fine specimen! Black as the abyss, sleek as the wind. Ye done well, whelp - ye might not be a complete disappointment after all! As promised, I'll ferry ye to Wyrm Cliffs. But if ye be lookin' for more cursed treasures, Chris the Tailor be the one to talk to next."] = "Har har! Teraz TO jest piekny okaz! Czarny jak otchlan.. Dobra robota, szczeniaku - moze nie jestes az taki zly! Jak obiecalam, zabiore cie na Wyrm Cliffs. Ale jesli szukasz wiecej przekletych skarbow, Krzysztof Kravvioc to twoj nastepny cel.",
	["Ye think ye can fool me, whelp? Where be me panther head? Unless ye got it, don't waste me time!"] = "Myslisz, ze mnie oszukasz, szczeniaku? Gdzie moj leb pantery? Jesli go nie masz, nie marnuj mojego czasu!",
	["Where we goin'?"] = "Dokad plyniemy?",
	["Har har! Ye reek of battle, matey! Ain't no captain fool enough to take a fighter fresh off the blood spillin'! Rest yer bones a while - let the sea wash away the fight. Then, and only then, I'll take ye where ye need goin'."] = "Arr arr! Smierdzisz bitwa, kamracie! Zaden kapitan nie jest na tyle glupi, by zabierac wojownika prosto z krwawej jatki! Odpocznij chwile! Niech morze zmyje z ciebie walke. Dopiero wtedy cie zabiore.",
	["Ahoy there, matey! Good to see a proper sea dog returnin' to these waters. Ye need a ship to sail? - no trouble. Just say the word, and we'll set {sail}!"] = "Ahoy, kamracie! Dobrze widziec prawdziwego wilka morskiego wracajacego na te wody. Potrzebujesz statku? - zaden problem. Powiedz tylko slowo, a wyruszymy!",
	["The sea whispers yer name now, aye. If it's Naga Island ye be seekin', I can ferry ye there through waters few dare to tread. But be warned - the spirits be watchin' always. Speak, and we set sail."] = "Morze wyszeptuje teraz twoje imie. Jesli szukasz Wyspy Nag, moge cie tam zabrac przez wody, po ktorych malo kto sie odwazy zeglowac. Ale uwazaj - duchy zawsze patrza. Mow, a wyruszymy.",
	["Ah, another traveler seekin' passage? I don't trade in steel and blood, but I do trade in legend. The Broken Ring of Ending - an artifact lost to time. Bring it to me, and I'll sail ye to Naga Island. Im the only one on this hemisphere that can take you there And trust me, mate, I can tell a fraud when I see one."] = "Kolejny podroznik szukajacy darmowych rejsow? U mnie sie zapierdala na takie uslugi! Jestem jedynym na {polnoc}nej polkuli, ktory zabierze cie na wyspe nag. Jesli chcesz zebym Cie tam zabral, przynies mi jeden ring of ending. Juz twoja glowa w tym jak gdzie go znalezc.",
	["A relic woven with endings and beginnings... Aye, this be a rare treasure indeed. Ye've done well, traveler. As promised, I'll take ye to Naga Island. And a word of advice - when dealin' with the serpents there, mind yer words. They be listenin'. I almost forgot - one can sail there only on a tide!"] = "W istocie rzeczy jest to okaz jakze rzadki i cenny.. Dobra robota. Jak obiecalem, zabiore cie na wyspe Nag. Zapomnilem wspomniec wczesniej - na wyspe Nag mozna doplynac tylko podczas przyplywu",
	["Now now, I ain't blind! That ring ain't in yer possession, so don't be tellin' tales, lad!"] = "Przeciez nie jestem slepy! Nie masz przy sobie tego pierscienia!",
	["Arrr, ye look like a scallywag with a bit o' spine! Just the sort I be needin' fer a dangerous errand. I got me eyes set on a trophy fit fer a pirate king - a Hydra's head! Aye, ye heard me right. A beast with more heads than a crew o' drunkards after a raid! But I only be needing' to see one. Ye bring back that head, and i promise there be place among our crew for ye."] = "Arrr, wygladasz na draba z kszta odwagi! Dokladnie kogos takiego mi trzeba do tej roboty. Mam oko na trofeum godne krola piratow - leb Hydry! A! Dobrze slyszales. Bestia z wieksza liczba lbow niz ta szajka pijakow z.. niewazne. Ale mnie wystarczy jeden leb. Przynies mi go, a obiecuje, ze znajdzie sie dla ciebie miejsce w naszej zalodze.",
	["Back again, eh? I knew ye had some guts in ye. If ye be needin' a {ship}, I can make it happen. Ain't no safer way than ridin' with me! Just say the word, and we be off."] = "Znowu tutaj, co? Wiedzialem, ze masz w sobie odwage. Jesli potrzebujesz {statku}, moge to zalatwic. Nie ma bezpieczniejszej podrozy niz ze mna! Powiedz tylko slowo, a ruszamy.",
	["Har har! If it ain't me favorite beast hunter! Ye lookin' fer a ride? Lucky ye - me ship {sail}s the seas. Just give the word, and I'll get us anywhere faster than a shark on fresh prey."] = "Arr! A toz to moj ulubiony lowca bestii! Szukasz transportu? Masz szczescie - moj statek {zegluje} po morzach. Powiedz tylko slowo, a zabiore nas tam szybciej niz rekin na swieza zdobycz.",
	--Questlog
	["Try to find the next pirate lord and gain his trust."] = "Sprobuj znalezc nastepnego lorda piratow i uzyskac jego zaufanie.",
	["Show one freshly cut hydra head to Redbeard."] = "Pokaz swieza glowe hydry Rudobrodemu.",
	["Lady Ironhook wants you to bring her one panther head."] = "Zyleta chce, abys sprezentowal jej glowe Pantery.",
	["Chris the Tailor send you out on a mission to find a broken ring of ending. Find it and bring it back to him."] = "Krzysztof Kravvioc zlecil ci znalezienie ring of ending.",
	["You helped all pirate lords."] = "Pomogles wszystkim pirackim lordom.",
	["Bring 10 sapphires to Morgram."] = "Przynies 10 szafirow do morgrama.",
}
